# Acceptance Criteria

- Exactly three storyboard image prompts.
- Each prompt requests one 2×3 grid containing exactly six sequential panels.
- Exactly three video prompts.
- Default video duration is 10 seconds per scene; total default duration is 30 seconds.
- Scene 2 begins from Scene 1's final action/pose; Scene 3 begins from Scene 2's final action/pose.
- Character Continuity Lock and Product Continuity Lock are present.
- Negative Prompt, story summary, production specifications, and checklist are present.
- User-selected language and narration on/off preference are respected.
- Product claims are supported by user-provided or verified information.
- No claim that prompts have been rendered into images/videos without an actual generation tool result.
- The workflow remains independent of WOWSERU AI ANIMASI.
